{
  "id": 399598803,
  "iid": 20558,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "PFCP: Add dissection support for Juniper CP ID IE (32943)",
  "description": "Adds support for the Juniper vendor-specific PFCP Information Element with\nIE Type 32943 (\"CP ID\") and Enterprise ID 2636. The dissector extracts the\nopaque ASCII-encoded Control Plane Identifier string and displays it in the\npacket details pane.\n\nThis IE is registered via the pfcp_register_generic_ie_dissector()\ninfrastructure, and integrated using Wireshark’s enterprise IE dispatch\nframework. Field name is \"pfcp.jnpr.cp_id\".\n\nThis change improves readability and vendor support for Juniper-specific\nPFCP deployments.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-07-15T20:11:16.741Z",
